    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056640/extras/38d529edf6da4389e8d54012d27a4b8a.avif?t=1688386008\" /></div><br>This game that need a little imagination, exploring the abstract landscape and aim of revive the mysterious monument.<br><br>To revive the monument, Need to build a unique motion.<br>The Object with motion fragment are hidden in landscape.<br>Collect and place them in the right place on the stone board to revive the monument.<br><br>Walking a bit can be a hassle, but there isn't much to do.<br>Enjoy the exploring and letting your imagination run wild!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple UI and operation<br></li><li>Full controller support<br></li><li>Steam Cloud<br></li><li>Addition of new levels(planned)</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">#1 Grass field</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056640/extras/4c918d8ed6ee901cd34f4ed75f9108f2.avif?t=1688386008\" /></div><br>It is a refreshing the grass fields with the wind.<br>Find the pieces hidden in the grass.",
